{"type":"standard","title":"Frank J. Mrvan","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Frank J. Mrvan</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q96077897","titles":{"canonical":"Frank_J._Mrvan","normalized":"Frank J. Mrvan","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Frank J. Mrvan</span></span>"},"pageid":64157416,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Frank_Mrvan_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg/330px-Frank_Mrvan_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/Frank_Mrvan_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2360,"height":2950},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1381282457","tid":"8e99676c-cd28-11f1-b95c-49023e04cc1c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T08:22:30Z","description":"American mortgage broker & politician (born 1969)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_J._Mrvan","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_J._Mrvan?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_J._Mrvan?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Frank_J._Mrvan"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_J._Mrvan","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Frank_J._Mrvan","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_J._Mrvan?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Frank_J._Mrvan"}},"extract":"Frank John Mrvan is an American politician who has served as the U.S. representative for Indiana's 1st congressional district since 2021. From 2005 until 2021, he served as the township trustee for North Township, Indiana. Mrvan is a member of the Democratic Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Frank John Mrvan</b> is an American politician who has served as the U.S. representative for Indiana's 1st congressional district since 2021. From 2005 until 2021, he served as the township trustee for North Township, Indiana. Mrvan is a member of the Democratic Party.</p>"}